# TradingOS V2 - Frontend Environment Configuration (Vercel / Local)
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# Any variable prefixed with VITE_ is statically compiled into client-side JavaScript.
# It is completely visible to anyone visiting the website in their browser.
#
# NEVER INCLUDE:
# - Bybit API keys or secrets (BYBIT_API_KEY, BYBIT_API_SECRET)
# - Database URLs (DATABASE_URL, Neon PostgreSQL credentials)
# - Private encryption keys or JWT secrets
# - Telegram bot tokens
#
# Local development:
# Leave unset to default to http://127.0.0.1:8765, or specify explicitly:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765

# Production on Vercel:
# Set this in your Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://<your-render-backend-service>.onrender.com
